  "bodyHash": "5b8a5ee7e74dce57",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>理智：疯狂的深渊</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">一款将《Don't Starve》中理智机制引入Minecraft的模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><strong>要求</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.19.4.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更新时请删除配置文件以重新生成并应用新配置变更，请注意自行备份配置修改内容。</span><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>说明</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组新增一个需要管理的核心属性——理智值（精神健康条）。若未能保持理智值在高位，将对生存造成严重后果，甚至导致死亡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">随着理智值下降，您将开始听到和看到幻象，视野变得模糊混沌，精神逐渐恍惚，最终会被内心具象化的存在攻击。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分敌对生物也会根据您的精神状态做出特殊反应...</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/main/readme/sanity_animation.gif\" alt=\"理智值动画\" width=\"325\" height=\"134\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">恢复理智值有多种途径，失智的方式同样繁多。详情请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/wiki/Activities-that-affect-sanity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki页面</a>。不过，建议您首先用途中采集的小花制作一个花环饰品，可短暂延缓理智流失。注意：水会显著加速花环枯萎！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/main/readme/garland_craft.png\" alt=\"花环合成配方\" width=\"242\" height=\"128\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px<strong>详细信息</strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组高度可定制化，具体设置请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/croissantnova/SanityDescentIntoMadness/blob/main/config.toml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置文件</a>。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">同时支持维度专属配置：<span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">config/sanitydim/dimension/custom_config.toml</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎将此模组收录至您的整合包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>已知问题</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">mc1.16版本存在实体动画异常，但不影响主要游戏体验。</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>致谢</strong></span><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">croissantnova - 程序员与美术</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/toujourspareil_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">toujourspareil</a> - 美术设计（附<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.ibb.co%252f1n03LBG%252f2023-06-18-14-34.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">授权同意书</a>）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">音效由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.zapsplat.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zapsplat</a> 提供。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>许可证</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">详见 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fcroissantnova%252fSanityDescentIntoMadness%252fmain%252fLICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">授权协议</a>。</span></p>",
